# @PROJECT_NAME@

This is a runnable KuroganeOS `@TEMPLATE@` SDK scaffold. It links statically
against the public CRT, libc, libkurogane and libui ABI and requires these
runtime features: `@REQUIRED_FEATURE_NAMES@`.

Build against a generated SDK sysroot:

```sh
make KUROGANE_SYSROOT=/path/to/kurogane/sysroot
```

The output `build/@PROJECT_NAME@` is an ELF64 ET_EXEC image. Copy it to the
system filesystem (normally `/apps/@PROJECT_NAME@`) and launch it from the
userspace shell. This SDK is KuroganeOS-native and does not claim POSIX binary
compatibility.
